(2 < 9) bèrdat: { Salida skirbi: ['Yes, nine is less than ten.']. }.
(9 < 2) bèrdat: { Salida skirbi: ['My logic fails']. }.
Salida skirbi: (-2 + 6).
Salida skirbi: (-3 - -3).
>> TrueIsNice := 3.
Salida skirbi: TrueIsNice.
>> FalseIsBad := ['Not true!'].
Salida skirbi: FalseIsBad.
>> NilIsEmpty := ['Yep'].
Salida skirbi: NilIsEmpty.
